  "summary": "Premier article de la série \"Artisan cadreur\", 200alaronde a rendu visite à la société EDELBIKES lundi 27 avril dernier : Nous avons décidé de promouvoir les artisans du cycle isérois à travers notre blog pour vous faire découvrir le vélo made in 38 EDELBIKE r",
  "featured_image": "",
  "body": "<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Premier article de la série \"Artisan cadreur\", 200alaronde a rendu visite à la société <strong>EDELBIKES</strong> lundi 27 avril dernier :</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Nous avons décidé de promouvoir les artisans du cycle isérois à travers notre blog pour vous faire découvrir le vélo made in 38</em>  </p>\n\n\n\n<p> EDELBIKE réalise des cadres acier depuis 2007.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.edelbikes.com/\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/logoedelbikes.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-596\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Francois nous accueille dans sa boutique et nous fait découvrir son univers : </p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__gallery\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__row\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__col\" style=\"flex-basis:34.75843%\"><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"2048\" data-id=\"580\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=580\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4637.jpeg\" data-width=\"1536\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4637.jpeg\" /></figure></div><div class=\"tiled-gallery__col\" style=\"flex-basis:30.48314%\"><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"1536\" data-id=\"579\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=579\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4638.jpeg\" data-width=\"2048\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4638.jpeg\" /></figure><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"1536\" data-id=\"582\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=582\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4639.jpeg\" data-width=\"2048\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4639.jpeg\" /></figure></div><div class=\"tiled-gallery__col\" style=\"flex-basis:34.75843%\"><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"2048\" data-id=\"581\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=581\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4640.jpeg\" data-width=\"1536\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4640.jpeg\" /></figure></div></div><div class=\"tiled-gallery__row\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__col\" style=\"flex-basis:50.00000%\"><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"2048\" data-id=\"578\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=578\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4642.jpeg\" data-width=\"1536\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4642.jpeg\" /></figure></div><div class=\"tiled-gallery__col\" style=\"flex-basis:50.00000%\"><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"2048\" data-id=\"583\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=583\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4643.jpeg\" data-width=\"1536\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/img_4643.jpeg\" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p>Il fabrique tout type de cadre acier : Gravel, Route, Tandem, vélo voyage, VTT, Fat... avec différents types d'acier (Reynolds, Columbus, Dedacciai&nbsp;...)</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Chaque vélo qui sort de l'atelier est unique et sur mesure : François prend vos côtes (venez avec votre vélo actuel) ou si vous le souhaitez, récupère les informations d'une étude posturale faite au préalable...</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Voici quelques réalisations que vous pouvez retrouver sur le site <a href=\"https://www.edelbikes.com/galerie/\">ici</a></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/8668545941_3bda3b7c97_c.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-551\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/35413727730_1d1be8e4de_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-552\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/35414109240_0eb4a1410a_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-554\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/33413337890_7e39c85cbb_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-553\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/40541627435_f9caad3500_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-555\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/49058508018_a46d7a10c9_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-557\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/48328921237_6f1292e8a3_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-556\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/49237384296_fa0d776c7d_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-558\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/51389255884_14b6d4410c_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-559\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/51159520203_793bc8e40f_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-560\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/52153191054_8f458feea8_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-561\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/52702910115_19915acd50_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-565\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/52945400788_48fa98d8c1_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-567\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/52752944087_920a80964d_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-562\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/53072743361_ccba5b1413_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-566\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/53496373360_037db40185_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-564\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/53908384665_4d9e6fe8a6_h.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-563\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>En plus de son activité, François propose des stages de 5 jours pour apprendre à construire son propre cadre acier. De nombreux jeunes cadreurs sont passés par chez lui avant de créer à leur tour leur propre structure.</p>\n\n\n\n<p> <a href=\"https://boutique.edelbikes.com/categorie-produit/stage/\">https://boutique.edelbikes.com/categorie-produit/stage/</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Olivier G. un adhérent de 200alaronde à fabriqué le sien lors d'un des stages :</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__gallery\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__row\"><div class=\"tiled-gallery__col\" style=\"flex-basis:53.15178%\"><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"2048\" data-id=\"585\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=585\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/f73b8332-51e7-478f-8e99-351b56fc8f27.jpg\" data-width=\"1536\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/f73b8332-51e7-478f-8e99-351b56fc8f27.jpg\" /></figure></div><div class=\"tiled-gallery__col\" style=\"flex-basis:46.84822%\"><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"1536\" data-id=\"586\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=586\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/85382d48-aef3-4320-87b5-29a07c498b1e.jpg\" data-width=\"2048\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/85382d48-aef3-4320-87b5-29a07c498b1e.jpg\" /></figure><figure class=\"tiled-gallery__item\"><img alt=\"\" data-height=\"1536\" data-id=\"587\" data-link=\"https://200alaronde.wordpress.com/?attachment_id=587\" data-url=\"/assets/media/2026/04/f200d4ff-f69e-4662-9a4f-24c3c0b05698.jpg\" data-width=\"2048\" src=\"/assets/media/2026/04/f200d4ff-f69e-4662-9a4f-24c3c0b05698.jpg\" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Visitez l'atelier / boutique EDELBIKES :</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">22 rue Charrel 38000 GRENOBLE</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Tél: 07 65 70 13 42<br>Mail:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:contact@edelbikes.com\">contact@edelbikes.com</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Instagram : <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/_edelbikes_/\">https://www.instagram.com/_edelbikes_/</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>",
